# Retracted v4 PDFs. The withdrawn manuscripts, monograph, supplement and pitch
# dossier are kept in this repository as LaTeX sources under paper/superseded_v4/,
# so every withdrawn claim AUDIT.md cites remains checkable against what was
# actually written. Their compiled PDFs are not published here: they carry the
# authors' contact details on their title pages, and build_docs.sh already refuses
# to render fresh copies of withdrawn claims (see its header). The retraction
# notices in those directories ARE tracked and rendered.
paper/superseded_v4/main.pdf
paper/superseded_v4/computational_coupling_paper.pdf
paper/superseded_v4/computational_coupling_technical_monograph.pdf
paper/superseded_v4/supplementary_information.pdf
paper/superseded_v4/pitch/computational_coupling_pitch.pdf
